  "id": "ss.relic.coldblood",
  "name": "Cold blood",
  "description": "One big drop of blood the wrong colour — frost blue, round-bellied, tip up — with an ice crystal grown inside it: six arms off one point, no two the same length, two of them branched. The drop is the body's blood and the crystal is what it does to a mouth that tastes it, which is the relic: whatever bites you is dazed for two seconds. The crystal's arms are uneven on purpose, because six even arms in a circle is a snowflake logo, and the drop is drawn large and single so it cannot be mistaken for the small green drop landing on ss.relic.venom's slab.",
